  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-06-01T06:00:21.209Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As of right now, player physics respond to moving objects (e.g. elevators) and adjust accordingly to an extent, but it's often imperfect and doesn't work horizontally in most cases. Presumably the fact that this sometimes works at all is an accident, so modifications to player physics to correctly respond to moving objects would be a very appreciated improvement for world developers.",
